//! DB copy / migration (docs/db-copy.md, binding). Copies the schemas, tables (PostgreSQL: also
//! its other schema objects) and data of one database into another database of the same family
//! (`postgres`, `mysql`, `sqlite`), converting character sets on the way.
//!
//! Copy is BulkDB's only writer, and only into a write-allowed target connection. Every target
//! statement is generated by BulkDB (or taken from the source catalog's definition functions),
//! listed in the plan, and checked against a per-family allow-list (5.2, `guard`).
//!
//! Module owners (section 10.2):
//! * **copy-schema**: `schema/`, `translate/`, `plan.rs`.
//! * **copy-data**: everything else here (types, api, exec, data, target, checkpoint, verify,
//!   preflight, guard, hash, testkit).

pub mod api;
pub mod checkpoint;
pub mod data;
pub mod exec;
pub mod facts;
